*~

# Python bytecode. There is still no build step and no packaging.
# (The "no virtualenv" this comment used to claim came from ARCHITECTURE.md §2,
# which describes candidate 1. Candidate 2 was adopted and IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
# §1.2 fixes the runtime as a project virtual environment — see the next stanza.)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The project virtual environment. IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md §1.2 fixes the suite
# command as `.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q` from the repository root, so every
# developer has one of these and none of them belongs in the repository. It is
# rebuilt from requirements.txt — see README.md.
.venv/
/venv/
.pytest_cache/

